WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.600
[Upbeat music and interface sounds]
Still waiting? Where's the truck? Which day and waste type? Missed an update?

00:03.600 --> 00:05.500
Still waiting, with no idea
when the truck will arrive?

00:05.500 --> 00:08.000
Unclear collection days. Confusing waste types.
Missed local updates.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.500
Meet GreenWay Candelaria.
Collection schedules, truck tracking, and local updates in one app.

00:12.500 --> 00:18.800
Create an account, save your recovery code,
or sign in to GreenWay.

00:18.800 --> 00:22.400
Make GreenWay yours.
Add your name and choose your avatar.

00:22.400 --> 00:26.400
Choose your barangay
to get collection updates for your area.

00:26.400 --> 00:33.300
Use your current location,
then choose your nearest detected street.

00:33.300 --> 00:35.000
Your GreenWay dashboard is ready.

00:35.000 --> 00:44.000
Know what to prepare.
Check your collection day, waste type, pickup time, and accepted materials.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.850
Follow your collection truck.
See its location and collection progress.

00:49.850 --> 00:57.100
[Notification chime]
Get a heads-up within 500 meters. Prepare before the truck arrives.

00:57.100 --> 01:00.300
Open the nearby-truck notification
to view the update and track the collection.

01:00.300 --> 01:07.500
Report an issue.
Choose a waste concern, add location details and a photo, then submit.

01:07.500 --> 01:12.000
Follow your report's progress over time.
[Notification chime] Your report has been resolved.

01:12.000 --> 01:20.000
Stay connected to your community.
Read waste tips and community events.

01:20.000 --> 01:25.000
Your updates. One inbox.
Open a General Notice announcement and read the full message.

01:25.000 --> 01:27.500
[GreenWay logo appears; music fades out]
